  - protocol
abstract: >-
  GeoSpark is an open-source Geospatial Intelligence Protocol and Engine
  that gives AI models genuine spatial reasoning capabilities. LLMs achieve
  0% on geodesic distance computation across 4/5 model families tested;
  GeoSpark provides ground-truth spatial computation via a standardized
  protocol, autonomous agents, and MCP server integration.
